", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:39:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114758767543787604"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/vshih2/status/…", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/vshih2/status/2114619515615207865", "start": 140, "url": "https://t.co/4aFpa3EB9j"}]}, "id": "2114758767543787604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 172, "impression_count": 36290, "like_count": 300, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 64}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114619515615207865", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Good Victor Shih piece on Chinese debt. Within a year it won’t just be a few worried economists at PKU and THU who talk about Chinese debt. https://t.co/4aFpa3EB9j", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2114758767543787604"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:38:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114758534483128826"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TurnerNovak/st…", "end": 259, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TurnerNovak/status/2114560778091053416", "start": 236, "url": "https://t.co/Juy02CVnp7"}]}, "id": "2114758534483128826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 37, "impression_count": 43278, "like_count": 508, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 47, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114560778091053416", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Oh yeah this is the other thing. Apparently in the plans to re-do part of Tompkins Square Park they want to replace the Handball courts (based, traditional, intensely athletic) with Pickleball courts (Instagram reels-ass pretend-sport) https://t.co/Juy02CVnp7", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114758534483128826"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:36:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114758135730557277"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 54, "start": 47, "tag": "copper"}], "urls": [{"description": "He Jinbi, one of the biggest names in Chinese copper trading, has been sentenced to life in prison over fraud and other offenses committed by the company he founded, Maike Metals International Co.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-26/chinese-copper-titan-he-jinbi-jailed-for-life-over-maike-fraud", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114616614725582848/t4_9Ts7i?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114616614725582848/t4_9Ts7i?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 177, "status": 200, "title": "Chinese Copper Titan He Jinbi Jailed for Life Over Maike Fraud", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-26/chinese-copper-titan-he-jinbi-jailed-for-life-over-maike-fraud", "url": "https://t.co/qUPBoDD4dO"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ChinaBeigeBook…", "end": 224, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113471815699820880", "start": 201, "url": "https://t.co/lWz7Q4VqgE"}]}, "id": "2114758135730557277", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2598, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113471815699820880", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"He Jinbi, one of the biggest names in Chinese #copper trading, has been sentenced to life in prison over fraud &amp; other offenses committed by the company he founded, Maike\"\nhttps://t.co/qUPBoDD4dO https://t.co/lWz7Q4VqgE", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114758135730557277"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:30:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114756664666538469"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 1, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "Police investigate accounts accused of using negative coverage to pressure companies into paying for its removal", "display_url": "caixinglobal.com/2026-10-26/chi…", "end": 152, "expanded_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-26/china-cracks-down-on-extortion-by-financial-media-accounts-102497492.html", "images": [{"height": 373, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114756669443907584/8kJRNIsb?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114756669443907584/8kJRNIsb?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 129, "status": 200, "title": "China Cracks Down on Extortion by Financial Media Accounts", "unwound_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-26/china-cracks-down-on-extortion-by-financial-media-accounts-102497492.html", "url": "https://t.co/4byp98AQIr"}]}, "id": "2114756664666538469", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2437, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "\"#China is intensifying its crackdown on financial media accounts suspected of \"extorting\" businesses through negative coverage\"\nhttps://t.co/4byp98AQIr", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114756664666538469"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:24:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114755083376136213"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 1, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2114755083376136213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2515, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "\"#China’s central bank has launched a swap facility to provide liquidity directly to nonbank financial institutions facing heavy redemptions during periods of bond-market stress.\n\nThe Bond Market NBFI Swap Facility (BNSF) is designed to bypass commercial banks that may be", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114755083376136213"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:59:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114748846769127829"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 32, "id": "872519322077470721", "start": 18, "username": "SchwabNetwork"}, {"end": 68, "id": "2189551761", "start": 55, "username": "MarleyKayden"}], "urls": [{"description": "@CharlesSchwab's Liz Ann Sonders, Chief Market Strategist at the Sc...", "display_url": "youtu.be/aQXxKZyaNNM", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/aQXxKZyaNNM", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114748850745278466/gvn2deH4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114748850745278466/gvn2deH4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 183, "status": 200, "title": "Lessons Liz Ann Sonders Learned After Decades on Wall Street", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQXxKZyaNNM&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/EeIQmfyyBe"}, {"display_url": "open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBD…", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBDGTJmXGNB7uZj2UFA?si=cy64LO4bQpaDfnSFCL5b5w", "start": 211, "status": 200, "unwound_url": "https://open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBDGTJmXGNB7uZj2UFA?si=cy64LO4bQpaDfnSFCL5b5w", "url": "https://t.co/xryaWaS9f5"}]}, "id": "2114748846769127829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 24560, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "I recently joined @SchwabNetwork's Market Matters with @MarleyKayden to share lessons learned during 40 years on Wall Street and how many of those early lessons still apply today.\n\n🎥 https://t.co/EeIQmfyyBe\n\n🎙️ https://t.co/xryaWaS9f5", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114748846769127829"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114737339838988426"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MattBruenig/st…", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MattBruenig/status/2114735474275201478", "start": 159, "url": "https://t.co/J6Vhr5f1wg"}]}, "id": "2114737339838988426", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 76478, "like_count": 431, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 49, "retweet_count": 18}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114735474275201478", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "YIMBYs are so funny to me. \n\n\"I've made a fascinating observation. It turns out that people don't like it when their neighborhoods undergo massive disruption\" https://t.co/J6Vhr5f1wg", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114737339838988426"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:41:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114729169967808657"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XqtvCjW93f", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114729169967808657/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114729165270241281", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/XqtvCjW93f"}]}, "id": "2114729169967808657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 19938, "like_count": 110, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "Worries about how AI buildout will be financed remain main drag on equities, particularly visible among hyperscalers; since early May, S&amp;P U.S.-Listed Hyperscalers Index has fallen by roughly a quarter, while over same period, tech borrowing costs have increased significantly; https://t.co/XqtvCjW93f", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114729169967808657"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:40:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114728779562045858"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oCPM6SHL2a", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728779562045858/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114728775715901440", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/oCPM6SHL2a"}]}, "id": "2114728779562045858", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 15615, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "S&amp;P 500 down slightly this month (-0.3%), yet 8 of 11 sectors have added to performance, led by Health Care, Financials, Energy and Consumer Staples; losses are concentrated: Technology (-2.0%) and Communication Services (-0.7%) have together taken around 2.7 percentage points https://t.co/oCPM6SHL2a", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728779562045858"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:38:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114728475483320801"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hxkvbmF51g", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728475483320801/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114728470408200192", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/hxkvbmF51g"}]}, "id": "2114728475483320801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 17650, "like_count": 101, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Theme that has driven markets for past couple of years is under pressure, but rest of the market is holding up well; last month, market breadth looked worryingly narrow but since then, signs of turnaround; S&amp;P 500 Equal Weight has outperformed its cap-weighted parent by ~4 https://t.co/hxkvbmF51g", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728475483320801"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114727124850643062"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Parks wants to tear down the basketball courts, the pull-up bars and the courtyard, and close them for two years. Community Board 3 votes Tuesday. Tell them: vote NO.", "display_url": "savetsp.github.io", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://savetsp.github.io/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114727127660793856/s0jZN38R?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114727127660793856/s0jZN38R?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 84, "status": 200, "title": "Tompkins needs you. Tuesday, Oct 27, 6:30pm, PS 20", "unwound_url": "https://savetsp.github.io/", "url": "https://t.co/JP5clX8vf1"}, {"display_url": "x.com/